{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261118/photo/bkn-20261118135835755-1118_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261118165655\"/><p>失蹤老翁黃木榮。</p><p>執法部門今日（18日）呼籲市民提供一名在銅鑼灣失蹤男子的消息。77歲老翁黃木榮，昨日（17日）上午離開其位於禮頓道的院舍後便告失蹤，院舍職員遂報案。</p><p>黃木榮身高約1.7米，體重約65公斤，中等身材，圓面形，黃皮膚及蓄短黑髮。他最後露面時身穿灰色長袖上衣、深色長褲及藍色涼鞋。任何人如有該失蹤男子的消息或曾見過他，請致電與調查人員聯絡。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T09:43:58.628519+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:58:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:14.250468+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T09:37:17.040538+00:00","content_hash":"9be7607b688af7fbfd50fc011f9384678778eb6d7af5f7bcde24086d7424b598","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T09:43:58.628519+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}